      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "BASEMENT (8) stalked the lead from a middle box before hitting the front turning and lifting to score (24.22) at this track in a Grade 5 over 425m. Winner at his latest appearance in one of the quickest times on the card. Has hit winning form and can measure up again. BORDER BEAST (7) was safely held last time out, finishing fifth at Horsham over 410m behind Paw Monet (24.08) in a Grade 5. Was a winner prior to that. Has won two of five starts from this draw. Worth following up. COMPARE JOE (5) jumps from box 5 for the first time after placing latest at Shepparton (22.49) in a Grade 5. Solid record at the distance winning three races. Expected to be in the finish again. BERSERKER VIKING (2) can play a role coming off a short let-up.",
